OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FMajor bridges in Kyiv have been
OL,8,Ftargeted by Russian strikes for four
OL,9,Fconsecutive days, as Moscow ramps up
OL,10,Fattacks on critical infrastructure in
OL,11,Fthe capital.
OL,13,FThe Pivnichnyi (Northern) Bridge was
OL,14,Fhit on Sunday morning, a day after it
OL,15,Fwas first hit in an attack that damaged
OL,16,Fthe road surface and led to traffic
OL,17,Fdisruption.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
