OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FKyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko said
OL,8,FSunday's strike on the bridge had
OL,9,Fdamaged a heating main, adding that
OL,10,Fthere would be a temporary lack of hot
OL,11,Fwater in the north-eastern Desnyanskyi
OL,12,Fdistrict as a result.
OL,14,FThe latest bridge attack came as German
OL,15,FChancellor Friedrich Merz made a
OL,16,Fsurprise visit to the capital on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
